inistrators \\n\\nProject Configuration \\n\\nInitialize repository with a README \\n\\nAllows you to immediately clone this project\u2019s repository. Skip this if you plan to push up an existing repository. \\n\\nEnable Static Application Security Testing (SAST) \\n\\nAnalyze your source code for known security vulnerabilities. [ Learn more. ](/help/user/application_security/sast/index.md)\\n\\nCreate project  [ Cancel  ](/dashboard/groups)\\n\\nLearn how to [ contribute to the built-in templates ](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/project-templates/contributing)\\n\\n  * Built-in  32 \\n\\n\\n\\n**Ruby on Rails**   \\n\\n\\nIncludes an MVC structure, Gemfile, Rakefile, along with many others, to help you get started \\n\\n[ Preview  ](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/project-templates/rails) Use template \\n\\n**Spring**   \\n\\n\\nIncludes an MVC structure, mvnw and pom.xml to help you get started \\n\\n[ Preview  ](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/project-templates/spring) Use template \\n\\n**NodeJS Express**   \\n\\n\\nIncludes an MVC structure to help you get started \\n\\n[ Preview  ](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/project-templates/express) Use template \\n\\n**iOS (Swift)**   \\n\\n\\nA ready-to-go template for use with iOS Swift apps \\n\\n[ Preview  ](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/project-templates/iosswift) Use template \\n\\n**.NET Core**   \\n\\n\\nA .NET Core console application template, customizable for any .NET Core project \\n\\n[ Preview  ](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/project-templates/dotnetcore) Use template \\n\\n**Android**   \\n\\n\\nA ready-to-go template for use with Android apps \\n\\n[ Preview  ](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/project-templates/android) Use template \\n\\n**Go Micro**   \\n\\n\\nGo Micro is a framework for micro service development \\n\\n[ Preview  ](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/project-templates/go-micro) Use template \\n\\n**Pages/Bridgetown**   \\n\\n\\nEverything you need to create a GitLab Pages site using Bridgetown \\n\\