n topic names. [ Learn more ](/help/user/project/project_topics) . \\n\\nSave changes \\n\\nExpand \\n\\n##  Visibility, project features, permissions \\n\\nChoose visibility level, enable/disable project features and their permissions, disable email notifications, and show default emoji reactions. \\n\\n<::before><::after>\\n\\nProject visibility \\n\\nManage who can see the project in the public access directory.  [ Learn more ](/help/user/public_access.md) . \\n\\nPrivate  Internal  Public \\n\\nAccessible by anyone, regardless of authentication. \\n\\n**Additional options** Users can request access \\n\\nIssues \\n\\nFlexible tool to collaboratively develop ideas and plan work in this project.  [ Learn more ](/help/user/project/issues/index.md) . \\n\\nIssues \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nRepository \\n\\nView and edit files in this project. When set to **Everyone With Access** non-project members have only read access. \\n\\nRepository \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nMerge requests \\n\\nSubmit changes to be merged upstream. \\n\\nMerge requests \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nForks \\n\\nUsers can copy the repository to a new project. \\n\\nForks \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nGit Large File Storage (LFS) \\n\\nManages large files such as audio, video, and graphics files.  [ Learn more ](/help/topics/git/lfs/index.md) . \\n\\nGit Large File Storage (LFS) \\n\\nCI/CD \\n\\nBuild, test, and deploy your changes. Does not apply to project integrations. \\n\\nCI/CD \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nAnalytics \\n\\nView project analytics. \\n\\nAnalytics \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nSecurity and compliance \\n\\nSecurity and compliance for this project. \\n\\nSecurity and compliance \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nWiki \\n\\nPages for project documentation. \\n\\nWiki \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone